# Implementation Plan - Phase 8: Cloud Schema Synchronization

The objective is to push the [Task](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/tools/base44.ts#71-76) entity schema to the Base44 Cloud to resolve the 404/422 errors preventing the [CuriosityEngine](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/curiosity_engine.ts#14-99) from operating live.
Research confirmed that the SDK (`@base44/sdk`) is for data manipulation, not schema management. Therefore, we **MUST** use the CLI (`@base44/cli`) as originally requested by the user.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> I will attempt to debug the CLI installation (`npm install @base44/cli`). If strictly blocked by environment, manual user action might be needed, but I will try to self-heal first.

## Proposed Changes

### Configuration
#### [NEW] [base44/entities/Task.json](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/base44/entities/Task.json)
-   Already created. Defines the [Task](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/tools/base44.ts#71-76) entity.

### Execution Steps
1.  **Install CLI**: Run `npm install @base44/cli --verbose` to diagnose previous failure.
2.  **Push Schema**: Run `npx base44 entities push` (using the local project config).
3.  **Verify**: Run `npx tsx scripts/trigger_curiosity.ts` to confirm "Task Created" success.

## Verification Plan

